sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Farmer
  participant UI as Mobile PWA
  participant API as Flask API
  participant Auth as Session Control
  participant Guard as Image Validator
  participant AI as Tassel Predictor
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Farmer->>UI: Select or capture maize field photo
  UI->>API: Upload image with Bearer token
  API->>Auth: Validate token against current account
  Auth->>DB: Read status, role, permissions, session_version
  DB-->>Auth: Active account state
  Auth-->>API: Authorized Farmer
  API->>Guard: Validate size, MIME, decoding, and pixels
  Guard-->>API: UUID name, SHA-256, dimensions
  API->>DB: Store Image and encrypted ImageFile
  API-->>UI: image_id
  UI->>API: Request tassel prediction
  API->>AI: Infer with content/model cache key
  AI-->>API: Count, boxes, confidence, timing
  API->>DB: Store DetectionResult and audit log
  API-->>UI: Structured result
  UI-->>Farmer: Highlight tassels and explain result
